#   Host smtp.resend.com | Port 465 | Username resend | Password = RESEND_API_KEY
#   Sender email noreply@guidelearning.org | Sender name Guide
# Add RESEND_API_KEY to Cloudflare Pages env when Guide code sends mail; optional until then.
